{
  "name": "UpdateDeviceShadowDesiredData",
  "summary": "配置设备影子预期数据",
  "tags": "设备影子",
  "productshort": "IoTDA",
  "region_id": "af-south-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/shadow": {
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "DeviceShadow"
        ],
        "summary": "配置设备影子预期数据",
        "description": "应用服务器可调用此接口配置设备影子的预期属性(desired区),当设备上线或者设备上报属性时把属性下发给设备。\n\n设备影子介绍:\n设备影子是一个用于存储和检索设备当前状态信息的JSON文档。\n- 每个设备有且只有一个设备影子,由设备ID唯一标识\n- 设备影子用于存储设备上报的(状态)属性和应用程序期望的设备(状态)属性\n- 无论该设备是否在线,都可以通过该影子获取和设置设备的属性\n- 设备上线或者设备上报属性时,如果desired区和reported区存在差异,则将差异部分下发给设备,配置的预期属性需在产品模型中定义且method具有可写属性“W”才可下发\n- 该接口仅支持配置单个设备的设备影子的预期数据,如需多个设备的设备影子配置,请参见 [创建批量任务](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_0045.html)。\n\n限制:\n设备影子JSON文档中的key不允许特殊字符:点(.)、dollar符号($)、空char(十六进制的ASCII码为00)。如果包含了以上特殊字符则无法正常刷新影子文档。",
        "operationId": "UpdateDeviceShadowDesiredData",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:项目ID。获取方法请参见 [获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_1001.html) 。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-fA-F0-9]{1,32}$",
            "x-example": "04ed32dc1b0025b52fe3c01a27c2b0a8"
          },
          {
            "name": "Instance-Id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数说明**:实例ID。物理多租下各实例的唯一标识,一般华为云租户无需携带该参数,仅在物理多租场景下从管理面访问API时需要携带该参数。您可以在IoTDA管理控制台界面,选择左侧导航栏“总览”页签查看当前实例的ID。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "[0-9a-f-]{1,36}",
            "x-example": "1a7ffc5c-d89c-44dd-8265-b1653d951ce0"
          },
          {
            "name": "device_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:设备ID,用于唯一标识一个设备。在注册设备时直接指定,或者由物联网平台分配获得。由物联网平台分配时,生成规则为\"product_id\" + \"_\" + \"node_id\"拼接而成。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,128}$"
          },
          {
            "in": "body",
            "name": "UpdateDeviceShadowDesiredDataRequestBody",
            "description": "request",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/UpdateDesireds"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "device_id": "40fe3542-f4cc-4b6a-98c3-61a49ba1acd4",
                "shadow": [
                  {
                    "service_id": "WaterMeter",
                    "desired": {
                      "properties": {
                        "temperature": "60"
                      },
                      "event_time": "20151212T121212Z"
                    },
                    "reported": {
                      "properties": {
                        "temperature": "60"
                      },
                      "event_time": "20151212T121212Z"
                    },
                    "version": 2
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DeviceShadow"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.000006",
              "IOTDA.000008",
              "IOTDA.013002",
              "IOTDA.013003"
            ]
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "FORBIDDEN",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.001006",
              "IOTDA.000021",
              "IOTDA.013004"
            ]
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not Found",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.013000",
              "IOTDA.014000"
            ]
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "CONFLICT",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.014030"
            ]
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "INTERNAL SERVER ERROR",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.000001",
              "IOTDA.000020"
            ]
          }
        },
        "x-imports": "org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.ModelAttribute;javax.validation.Valid;org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-publishpath": "iot_06_v5_0072",
        "x-externalAPI": true,
        "x-returnType": "ResponseEntity<DeviceShadow>",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "PUT https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/shadow",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "配置设备影子预期数据",
        "x-request-examples-text-1": {
          "shadow": [
            {
              "service_id": "WaterMeter",
              "desired": {
                "temperature": "60"
              },
              "version": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-2": "PUT https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/shadow",
        "x-request-examples-description-2": "删除设备影子预期数据",
        "x-request-examples-text-2": {
